#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winner.text5"
msgstr "Mee naannoo <a %(all_isbns)s>barreeffama blogii duraa</a> ilaalaa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winner.text6"
msgstr "Qorannoo kana fooyyessuuf carraa kennee turre. Bakka jalqabaa $6,000, bakka lammaffaa $3,000, fi bakka sadaffaa $1,000 badhaasuuf turre. Deebii guddaa fi dhiyeessii dinqisiisaa argannee, badhaasa dorgommii xiqqoo dabaluuf murteessinee, bakka sadaffaa afur $500 tokkoon tokkoon badhaasuuf murteessine. Moo’attonni gadii jiru, garuu dhiyeessii hundaa <a %(annas_archive)s>asitti</a> ilaaluuf, yookaan <a %(a_2025_01_isbn_visualization_files)s>torrent walitti qabame</a> keenya buufachuuf."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.first"
msgstr "Bakka jalqabaa $6,000: phiresky"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.first.text1"
msgstr "Dhiyeessii <a %(phiresky_github)s>kana</a> (<a %(annas_archive_note_2951)s>yaada Gitlab</a>) waan barbaadne hunda, fi sana caalaa dha! Filannoo agarsiisa baay’ee jijjiiramaa ta’e (shaderwwan dhuunfaa dabalatee) akkasumas tarree filannoo dursee qophaa’e guutuu qabaachuu isaa baay’ee jaalanne. Akkasumas, saffisa fi laafina isaa, raawwii salphaa (kan bakka duubaa hin qabne), minimap yaadannoo, fi ibsa bal’aa blog isaanii keessatti kennan jaalanne. Hojii dinqisiisaa, fi mo’ataa sirrii!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second"
msgstr "Bakka lammaffaa $3,000: hypha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.text1"
msgstr "Dhiyeessii dinqisiisaa <a %(annas_archive_note_2913)s>kana</a>. Bakka jalqabaa caalaa jijjiiramaa miti, garuu agarsiisa sadarkaa guddaa isaa bakka jalqabaa caalaa jaalanne (kurva bakka guutuu, daangaa, mallattoo, ifaajee, fi xiqqeessuu). Yaada <a %(annas_archive_note_2971)s>Joe Davis</a> nu waliin hiriire:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.quote"
msgstr "“Yeroo murtaawaa fi murtaawaan sirriitti qophaa’an, haala mappii keessatti iddoo ol’aanaa hin kennan. Asymmetry kanneen Hilbert yookaan Morton sirrii keessatti argamu dogoggora osoo hin taane, amala dha. Fakkeenyaaf, daangaa kabajamaa Itaalyaa kan kophee fakkaatu mappii irratti yeroo mara beekamaa ta’uu isaa, kurva kanneen kunis iddoo yaadannoo ta’uu danda’u. Adda ta’uu isaanii yaadannoo iddoo fooyyessuu fi fayyadamtoota ofii isaanii qajeelchuuf gargaara, iddoo addaa argachuu yookaan fakkiiwwan argachuu salphisuuf.”"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.text2"
msgstr "Filannoo agarsiisa fi raawwii hedduu, akkasumas UI laafaa fi hubannoo qaba. Bakka lammaffaa cimaa!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third1"
msgstr "Bakka sadaffaa $500 #1: maxlion"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third1.text1"
msgstr "Barreeffama <a %(annas_archive_note_2940)s>kana</a> kanaa, ilaalcha garagaraa, keessumaa ilaalcha walbira qabuu fi maxxansaa jaalanne."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third2"
msgstr "Iddoo sadaffaa $500 #2: abetusk"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third2.text1"
msgstr "UI sirrii ta'uu baatus, <a %(annas_archive_note_2917)s>kana</a> kanaa hedduu ilaallata. Keessumaa ilaalcha walbira qabuu isaa jaalanne."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third3"
msgstr "Iddoo sadaffaa $500 #3: conundrumer0"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third3.text1"
msgstr "Iddoo duraa waliin wal fakkaatee, <a %(annas_archive_note_2975)s>kana</a> kanaa laafina isaa nu dinqisiifate. Dhuma irratti kun meeshaa ilaalcha guddaa taasisu: laafina ol'aanaa fayyadamtoota humna qabanif, yeroo tokko tokko immoo salphaa ta'uu isaa fayyadamtoota giddugaleessaaf."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third4"
msgstr "Iddoo sadaffaa $500 #4: charelf"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third4.text1"
msgstr "Barreeffama <a %(annas_archive_note_2947)s>kana</a> dhumaa kan badhaasa argate salphaa dha, garuu amaloota addaa kanneen jaalanne qaba. Datasets meeqa ISBN tokko keessatti argamu akka beekkama/amanamummaa ta'e agarsiisuun isaanii jaalanne. Akkasumas, salphaa garuu bu'a qabeessa ta'uu isaa agarsiisuuf slider opacity fayyadamuun isaanii jaalanne."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable"
msgstr "Yaadota beekamoo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.text1"
msgstr "Yaadota fi raawwiiwwan biroo kanneen jaalanne:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.BWV_1011"
msgstr "Skyscrapers kan baay'ina hin jirreef"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.robingchan"
msgstr "Lakkoofsa yeroo jiraataa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.reguster"
msgstr "Yaadannoo, akkasumas lakkoofsa yeroo jiraataa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.orangereporter"
msgstr "Ilaalcha map addaa fi filatoota"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.joe.davis"
msgstr "Sirna bifa aadaa fi heatmap."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.timharding"
msgstr "Datasets salphatti jijjiiruu danda'uu ilaalcha walbira qabuu saffisaaf."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.j1618"
msgstr "Barreeffama bareedaa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.immartian"
msgstr "Barreeffama kitaabota lakkoofsa waliin."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.backrndsource"
msgstr "Sliders baay'ee datasets walbira qabuu, akka DJ ta'uu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.text2"
msgstr "Yeroo dheeraa itti fufuu dandeenya, garuu asitti haa dhaabnu. Barreeffama hunda <a %(annas_archive)s>asitti</a> ilaaluuf, yookaan <a %(a_2025_01_isbn_visualization_files)s>torrent walitti qabame</a> keenya buufachuuf. Barreeffamoota baay'ee, fi tokkoon tokkoon isaanii ilaalcha addaa fidu, ta'uus UI yookaan raawwii keessatti."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.text3"
msgstr "Galmee duraa gara marsariitii keenya guddaa keessatti dabaluu ni yaalla, akkasumas kanneen biroo. Akkaataa kitaabota baay'ee hin argamne adda baasuu, mirkaneessuu, fi galmeessuu irratti yaaduu jalqabneerra. Kana irratti odeeffannoo dabalataa ni dhiyeessina."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.text4"
msgstr "Hirmaattonni hundi galatoomaa. Namoonni baay'een akka kanaaf yaadan waan ajaa'ibsiisaa dha."

