#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aac"
msgstr "<strong>AAC.</strong> AAC (Anna’s Archive Container) wanta tokkicha kan <strong>metadata</strong> fi yeroo tokko tokko <strong>daataa binary</strong> of keessaa qabu, kan lamaan isaanii hin jijjiiramne. Inni beeksisa addunyaa guutuu ta'e, kan <strong>AACID</strong> jedhamu qaba."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.collection"
msgstr "<strong>Collection.</strong> AAC kamiyyuu walitti qabama tokko keessatti argama, kan akkaataa hiikoo isaatiin walitti qabama AACs kan hiikoo wal simatu. Kunis yoo foormaaticha metadata jijjiirama guddaa ta'e, walitti qabama haaraa uumuu qabda jechuudha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.records-files"
msgstr "<strong>“records” fi “files” collections.</strong> Akkaataa walii galtee, yeroo baay'ee “records” fi “files” akka walitti qabama adda addaa gadhiisuun salphaa ta'uu danda'a, akkaataa yeroo gadhiisuu irratti, fakkeenyaaf, akkaataa saffisa sakatta'uu irratti. “Record” walitti qabama metadata qofa, kan odeeffannoo akka maqaa kitaabaa, barreessaa, ISBN, fi kkf of keessaa qabu, yeroo “files” immoo walitti qabama faayiloota dhugaa of keessaa qabu (pdf, epub)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid"
msgstr "<strong>AACID.</strong> Foormaatin AACID kunoo: <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__{collection}__{ISO 8601 timestamp}__{collection-specific ID}__{shortuuid}</code>. Fakkeenyaaf, AACID dhugaa kan gadhiifne <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z__22433983__URsJNGy5CjokTsNT6hUmmj</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection"
msgstr "<code>{collection}</code>: maqaa walitti qabama, kan qubee ASCII, lakkoofsa, fi qubee jala bu'aa of keessaa qabaachuu danda'u (garuu qubee jala bu'aa lama hin qabaatu)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.iso8601"
msgstr "<code>{ISO 8601 timestamp}</code>: gosa gabaabaa ISO 8601, yeroo UTC qofa, fakkeenyaaf <code>20220723T194746Z</code>. Lakkoofsi kun yeroo gadhiisuu hunda dabalaa deemu qaba, garuu hiikoo isaa sirriitti walitti qabama tokko tokko irratti garaagarummaa qabaachuu danda'a. Yeroo sakatta'uu ykn yeroo ID uumuu fayyadamuun ni gorfama."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection-id"
msgstr "<code>{collection-specific ID}</code>: beeksisa walitti qabama tokkoof qofa, yoo barbaachise, fakkeenyaaf, ID Z-Library. Haa hafuu ykn gabaabbachuu danda'a. Yoo AACID dheerina 150 qubee caalu qabaate, ni hafuu ykn ni gabaabbachuu qaba."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.shortuuid"
msgstr "<code>{shortuuid}</code>: UUID garuu gara ASCIItti dhiphifame, fakkeenyaaf base57 fayyadamuun. Amma <a %(github_skorokithakis_shortuuid)s>shortuuid</a> makiinaa Python fayyadamna."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid-range"
msgstr "<strong>AACID range.</strong> AACID yeroo dabalaa of keessaa qabaachuun isaanii, range keessatti walitti qabama tokko keessatti agarsiisuu dandeenya. Akkaataa kanaan fayyadamna: <code style=\"color: blue\">aacid__{collection}__{from_timestamp}--{to_timestamp}</code>, yeroo kunniin of keessatti qabatanii. Kun ISO 8601 sirna waliin walsimsiisa. Range walitti fufaa dha, fi walitti bu'uu danda'u, garuu walitti bu'uun yoo jiraate galmee walfakkaataa qabaachuu qaba kan duraan walitti qabame keessatti (AACs hin jijjiiramne waan ta'aniif). Galmee dhabuun hin hayyamamu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file"
msgstr "<strong>Faayilii metadata.</strong> Faayiliin metadata metadata AACs hedduu, walitti qabama tokkoof, of keessaa qaba. Isaan kun amaloota armaan gadii qabu:"

