msgstr "Maqaan faayilii dirree AACID ta’uu qaba, <code style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</code> jedhamuun jalqabamee fi <code>.jsonl.zstd</code> jedhamuun xumuramee. Fakkeenyaaf, gadhiinsi keenya tokko<br><code><span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z--20230808T023702Z</span>.jsonl.zst</code> jedhama."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.jsonlines"
