msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.fields"
msgstr "Objektiin JSON kamiyyuu dirree armaan gadii sadan sadarkaa ol’aanaa irratti of keessaa qabaachuu qaba: <strong>aacid</strong>, <strong>metadata</strong>, <strong>data_folder</strong> (filannoo). Dirree biroo hin eeyyamamu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.metadata"
msgstr "<code>metadata</code> metadata filannoo, akka hiika walitti qabamaatti, ta’e. Walitti qabama keessatti hiika qabeessa ta’uu qaba."

